description:
For the main site, we should list all of the package requirements (for both sessions). There were a few from the advanced extras that needed to be included. 

For each of the two intro decks, this PR updates the specific packages needed for the session (e.g., intro vs advances). 

@hfrick @simonpcouch Can you update/trim what you need in the intro slide "Let's install some packages"?

Closes #311. On the Washington State plot, incl w/ various colorblindness settings:

https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/61f305c0-00b8-4936-bcb4-7079ce46d9c2

@topepo, Hannah and I are transitioning the theming options underneath the intro slides to associate a more intuitive color with "forested" vs "non-forested" in various slides. This will affect plots of yours that don't set `scale_color_*()`/`scale_fill_*()`. Okay with you?
